ROOT CAUSE ANALYSIS:
Investigation of server logs and process list revealed:
- Duplicate server process: PID 82117 (from 2026-10-01 13:28, still running)
- Running alongside: PID 3614 (from 2026-10-02 21:41)
- The old process was intercept HTTP requests and returning 409 Conflict
- This prevented the fresh server instance from processing requests

